it is the official kickoff for walker  furniture's 27th home for the holidays  program  in which they donate households of  furniture to 35  families in need in our community linda  alterwitz missouri  owner of walker furniture is joining us  to tell us more about the program  that has been going on for so long and  has done so much good linda  how do you even select recipients  well first of all it's been going on for  27 years  which uh which we're really proud of um  we get almost close to a thousand  letters per year  and we invite how it works is we invite  the community  to write in a letter about someone in  need this year  whether it's a family member a neighbor  a friend and  tell us their story tell us what's going  on and  from all those selections we uh  we ask helping hands of nevada  to help us uh with that with that  large number of letters and they read  every single  letter uh and then they  narrow it down from all those letters to  about a hundred to 200  letters and then they make home visits  to verify the need  so they narrow it down to 45 and then  our amazing executive committee  does the final 35 recipients  yeah and i've had the the honor of being  part of that  for many years and i can't believe  how difficult it is because each and  every letter of those 45 that you guys  um send our way is  gut-wrenching and and heart-rending  because these are people in need these  are people who have been through a lot  and what you're bringing them is um some  solace in a  very very difficult time so it's it's  amazing what you guys  do tell us what each family will receive  well pretty much an entire household of  furniture  and living room dining room bedroom and  for instance if they have six  children each child will get their own  bed or  worth three sets of bunk beds um and  it's customized to the needs of the  family  and where they're living it's incredible  how can the community get involved  well you can write letters in about  somebody  that you know and go onto our website at  www.walkerfurniturehomefortheholidays.com  the easiest way to do is to submit it  electronically  or you could mail in a letter or stop by  either of our two locations one in  las vegas and one in henderson and just  let us know what's going on  with with the family or the individual  linda the generosity is amazing you have  helped so many families over the years  thank you thank you thank you  thanks for joining us today thank you  thank you walker furniture has two  locations they have one in las vegas and  one in henderson  those addresses are on your screen you  can also call them at that phone number  702-384-9300 or visit  walkerfurniture.com
 

